    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36624" root="كتأ" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَتْأَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A plant resembling the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرْجِيرٌ</span>, [or <i>rocket</i>],
(K,) <i>which is cooked and eaten.</i> (TA.) But
AM says it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثْأَةٌ</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span>; and it is also
called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْقٌ</span>, accord. to Aboo-Málik and others.
(TA.)

